#: src/Scanner/BrowserRules.php:54
msgid "Text has too little contrast with its background"
msgstr ""

#: src/Scanner/BrowserRules.php:55
msgid "The text and the colour behind it are too close in lightness for the text to be comfortably readable. This affects far more people than it might sound: everyone with low vision, anyone with colour vision deficiency, and every sighted person reading on a phone in daylight. Darken the text or lighten the background until the ratio reaches 4.5:1, or 3:1 for text at 24px, or 19px bold."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scanner/BrowserRules.php:59
msgid "A colour that clears the required ratio can be computed, and it is written into the site's own Additional CSS. The proposal keeps the hue and saturation already chosen and moves only as far as it must."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scanner/BrowserRules.php:61
msgid "Anyone with low vision or colour blindness — and anyone reading on a phone in daylight — will struggle to make this out."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scanner/BrowserRules.php:68
msgid "Link inside text is marked only by colour"
msgstr ""

#: src/Scanner/BrowserRules.php:69
msgid "This link sits inside a paragraph and is distinguished from the surrounding words by colour alone. Anyone who cannot separate those two colours cannot tell it is a link. Add an underline, or another visible difference that does not depend on colour."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scanner/BrowserRules.php:73
msgid "An underline is what the criterion asks for and what readers already recognise. One rule, no judgement."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scanner/BrowserRules.php:75
msgid "Anyone who cannot tell those two colours apart cannot tell there is a link here at all."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scanner/BrowserRules.php:82
msgid "Clickable target is smaller than 24 by 24 pixels"
msgstr ""

#: src/Scanner/BrowserRules.php:83
msgid "This control is small enough to be hard to hit accurately, which matters for anyone with a tremor, limited dexterity, or simply a phone in one hand on a moving bus. Make it at least 24 by 24 CSS pixels, or leave enough clear space around it that a near miss does not activate something else."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scanner/BrowserRules.php:87
msgid "A minimum size of 24 by 24 is the criterion itself. Applied as a floor, so the control can still grow."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scanner/BrowserRules.php:89
msgid "Hard to hit accurately for anyone with a tremor, limited dexterity, or a phone in one hand on a moving bus."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scanner/BrowserRules.php:96
