#: src/Scanner/ScanPass.php:65
msgid "Read from the page source on your server. Needs no browser, so it can run on a schedule and across your whole site."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scanner/ScanPass.php:66
msgid "Measured in a real browser, where colours, sizes and layout are known. Only runs while you have the dashboard open."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scanner/ScanScope.php:51
msgid "Single page"
msgstr ""

#: src/Scanner/ScanScope.php:52
msgid "Whole site"
msgstr ""

